host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title The queue that was never ranked, and a lift that found it
prompt Autonomous loop -- read the voice and style canon, then REMEMBER and the itineraries, close open reds first, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, read one council-rota row, send each finished increment as its own signed round
think Standfast first. Read crux/REDS.md end to end -- rows 142, 143, and 144 all stand CLOSED, zero rows read OPEN, so the line was clear for constructive work.
think Read the top rows of session-logs/README.md and the newest log's recommend line. The baton pointed at appraisal_note, leading the fall queue at 333 over thirty-eight rungs in the same twelve-line shape the prior lap folded one rung wider.
think Measured before cutting. tools/fixtures/ladder_reach_visibility_scan.sh appraisal_note read declared=38 identical=38 lines=12 stub=3 fall=333 widens=0, which matched the pinned row exactly.
think Lifted the body into caravan/ladder_checks.rye as pub fn appraisal_note(comptime rung: type, io: std.Io, held: u32, weighed_mask: u32) rung.NoteError!void, seated directly above appraisal_published so the writer and its only reader sit adjacent. Every symbol the body reaches -- max_queue_len, phase_bit, plan_name, seat_note, NoteError -- already stood public in all thirty-eight rungs, so the lift widened nothing.
think Replaced the twelve-line body in all thirty-eight rungs with a three-line stub returning ladder_checks.appraisal_note(@This(), io, held, weighed_mask). A python pass matched the exact elder text so a drifted rung would have been left alone; thirty-eight matched, the count the scan predicted.
think While rotating the witness pins I measured suits_path by hand out of the carry meter's printed tail. It returned 350 -- more than the 330 the witness asserted as the fall queue's head. The head was wrong, and the reason was structural rather than arithmetic.
think Found the root. The queue head had never been ranked. It came off three or four families a hand kept in the witness, and that handful was seeded from the carry meter's top rows. carry is (rungs - 1) * lines while a fall is (folding - 1) * (lines - stub), so carry over-weights breadth and a narrow family holding a long body scores low there and high here. Booked it as REDS %145.
think Closed it with a queue mode in the reach scan: build every family of two or more identical bodies, rank by carry, measure fall down that order. The search is exact rather than sampled because carry bounds fall from above -- folding <= rungs and lines - stub <= lines, so fall <= carry always.
think The first cut of the bound stopped at the best fall seen, which named the head correctly and truncated the tail wrongly -- bound_the_relay at 312 went unseen behind a head of 350 while term_written at 270 printed above it. Corrected to stop at the depth-th best fall, since a top-of-K list is complete only when nothing unexamined could displace its Kth row.
think Proved both refusal paths on generated controls: a ladder where no two rungs write one body refuses verdict=no_foldable rather than printing an empty list, and a control whose two orderings disagree -- broad at twenty rungs of four lines carrying 76 and returning 19, against deep at three rungs of twenty-one lines carrying 42 and returning 36 -- must name deep, so a meter reverting to carry refuses.
think Rewrote the reach witness to assert the ranked queue rather than a shortlist, and retuned every ordering claim in the surrounding prose to the rank. Updated the carry witness's two prose lines to this lap.
think Lowered the carry ceiling in both the witness and the scan default, 60,843 -> 60,510, and folded the closed rows 142 and 143 to crux/archive/ when row %145 pushed the living pin past its 24,576-byte bound.
obs Carry measured 60,843 -> 60,510 after the lift -- exactly 333, the number the scan's formula returned before the lap began. Seven laps running the arithmetic has named the fall before the meter read it.
obs The finding worth carrying is that an ordering is a measurement. REDS %130 booked a cost described rather than measured; this books an ordering, one level up. A leaderboard drawn from the rows you already know about answers about those rows and stays silent about every row nobody thought to add, which is an impression wearing a measurement's clothes.
obs The bias had a direction, and naming it is what makes the lesson portable. The shortlist was carry-seeded, and carry multiplies rungs by whole lines while a fall multiplies rungs-past-the-first by the lines a stub does not return. So the blind spot was systematically the narrow-and-deep family -- mind_the_impasse at eight rungs of fifty-three lines, hold_the_matter at seven of fifty-nine, bound_the_relay at seven of fifty-five -- three rows that each returned more than the asserted head and had never once been asked.
obs The correction demoted the standing head three places rather than confirming it, which is the evidence it is a correction. answered_by fell from first to fourth.
obs Forty-eight of seven hundred foldable families answer for all seven hundred, because the carry bound closes the search exactly. An exhaustive rank that opens seven percent of the field is affordable enough to run every lap, which is what turns a lantern into a loom.
obs The copy guard caught two of my own new GREEN lines on the lap they were written -- a twelve and a thirty spelled in words with no assert holding them. Both were rewritten to say what the file actually holds rather than earning asserts to justify prose, which is REDS %110 and %143 doing exactly their work.
obs The council rota row read this lap was Aether and Jupiter -- why the work exists. The Lindy essay landed directly on the lap: a meter is among the most Lindy-exposed things this arc owns, read every lap for as long as the arc runs, so an hour spent making its ordering true compounds where an hour spent on one more lift evaporates. And the grain's sameness strand -- count the whole cost of a line saved -- is what the fall column has been measuring all along.
loom witness=caravan_ladder_carry_witness carry_before=60843 carry_after=60510 fall=333 bodies=18195 distinct=7983
loom witness=caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness family=appraisal_note folding=38 lines=12 stub=3 widens=0
loom scan=ladder_reach_visibility_queue head=mind_the_impasse fall=350 examined=48 families=700 wall_s=71
loom witness=caravan_suite rungs=108 verdict=GREEN wall_s=520
obs The rank costs wall time, and the cost is named rather than absorbed. The queue mode adds about seventy-one seconds to tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish, which now stands as the slowest rung of a 108-witness choir that ran in about eight and a half minutes. An exhaustive rank once a lap is worth that; a meter nobody waits for would be worth less, so the number is recorded here to be watched rather than discovered later.
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the lifted appraisal_note body, seated above the appraisal_published that reads it back
file caravan/abate.rye and thirty-seven sibling rungs -- each twelve-line body replaced by a three-line stub
file tools/fixtures/ladder_reach_visibility_scan.sh the queue mode: an exact bounded rank of every foldable family by fall, with two prove-red controls
file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish the shortlist retired for the ranked queue; every ordering claim re-tuned to the rank
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish ceiling lowered to the measured carry; prose moved to this lap
file crux/REDS.md row %145 booked and closed; rows 142 and 143 folded to archive as the pin passed its bound
file crux/archive/REDS-line-citation-and-spelled-number-rows-142-143.md the fold, every byte kept
recommend keep-going mind_the_impasse leads the ranked queue at 350 over eight rungs of a fifty-three-line body widening nothing -- the deepest shape this arc has ever lifted and the first row the queue found rather than a hand, so the next lap tests whether a fifty-three-line body folds as cleanly as a twelve-line one; suits_path ties it at 350 over fifteen rungs of twenty-eight and is the direct sibling of the found_path family two laps back, so it is the safer of the two if the deep body turns out to reach something private
